# Dashboard

- Gate in `page.tsx` and in its `get-*.ts` (`requirePlatformAdmin`, `requireOrganizationManager`, `requireDashboardSession`); a layout gate is not enough.
- URLs in `dashboard-routes.ts`, tags in `cache-tags.ts`, admin/manage nav in `admin-slices.ts` / `organization-manage-tabs.ts`.
- Lists are URL-driven and server-rendered with `@/components/list`; copy `(organization)/manage/members/`.

Guide: [docs/agents/dashboard.md](docs/agents/dashboard.md)
